nexpected enthusiasm and proactivity in certain areas. When someone she likes shows interest in something, she tends to agree with them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After entering school, she began to admire the protagonist for some reason. She has been classmates with Chinatsu since childhood and although their personalities are different, they get along well. She has been in the same class as Yū since her first year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves books and is a little bit of a dreamer."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86986"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても温和な子で一見地味目な印象を受ける事もあるが、意外な所で勢いや積極性がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好意のある人に押されると大抵の事に頷いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学後、あるきっかけから主人公に憧れるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千夏とは昔からの同級生。性格は違うが不思議と仲がいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠とは一年生の時から同じクラスだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本が好きで、少しだけ夢見がちである。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22132","sourceWorkId":"28926","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても温和な子で一見地味目な印象を受ける事もあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外な所で勢いや積極性がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好意のある人に押されると大抵の事に頷いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学後、あるきっかけから主人公に憧れるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千夏とは昔からの同級生。性格は違うが不思議と仲がいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠とは一年生の時から同じクラスだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本がすきで、少しだけ夢見がちである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73271"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73271","value":"2年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd9331c050806e0f9a65dbb3ab2fbb629f0a3ce9f877d4e53bdf07d32b509946.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e3495f6f07806cbeb8080c7277406f3d0f338830d7abaa3239946d9147f6246.webp","width":92,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤あずさ","creatorId":"vndb:s3868","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3868","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3868","